<title>NETHERLANDS: NEWAYS LOWERS FULL-YEAR EXPECTATIONS.</title>
<headline>NEWAYS LOWERS FULL-YEAR EXPECTATIONS.</headline>
<text>
<p>AMSTERDAM, Aug 28 (reuter) - Neways Electronics NV said on Wednesday it expected full-year 1996 profits not to exceed 1995 profits.</p>
<p>Neways said that inspite of sharply higher first-half results it had to downgrade earlier expectations and that 1996 full-year results would not exceed those of 1995.</p>
<p>In 1995 the firm posted a net profit of 6.0 million guilders.  </p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +20 - 504 5000</p>
